, 'Racket Material', 'Pro rackets are made of aluminium.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'They are made of carbon fiber.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('0207a196-b72d-4d1d-9efe-87f5bda06d9f', 'badminton', 'Racket Tension', 'Strings lose tension even if the racket is not being used.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Nylon and natural gut strings gradually lose their elasticity over time due to the constant pull on the frame.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('02297539-1adf-49cf-9256-ca97dc3e8eba', 'science', 'Chemistry', 'What is the chemical symbol for Helium?', 'text', null, 'He', 'A noble gas used in balloons.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('029a643d-9157-4cc0-b3b1-c3f061ab1f21', 'badminton', 'Technique', 'The "Scissors Kick" is a footwork move used during which shot?', 'multiple_choice', '["Net Drop","Backhand Drive","Jump Smash","Short Serve"]', 'Jump Smash', 'The legs swap positions in mid-air to generate momentum and land ready for the next shot.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('02c6da07-0f59-4b87-95a2-6ad2ea46d32b', 'badminton', 'Double Hit', 'A player can hit the shuttle twice in one continuous stroke.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'If the shuttle hits the frame and strings in one stroke, it is now legal under modern rules.', '2026-05-04 16:35:11.324679+00'), ('02ec1b95-a556-404e-a5c7-8d60ea037cf9', 'wild rift', 'Lanes', 'The "Duo Lane" is typically played by a Marksman and a Support.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'The Duo Lane is usually on the side with the Dragon.', '2026-05-06 13:35:01.200745+00'), ('0339bded-a24a-44e7-92b6-c3d0fd27879b', 'science', 'Botany', 'What do bees collect from flowers to make honey?', 'multiple_choice', '["Pollen","Sap","Nectar","Seed"]', 'Nectar', 'Nectar is a sugar-rich liquid.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0349436f-04b5-4f3a-a012-fb11164f80be', 'badminton', 'Technique', 'A "Drive" is a high, arching shot aimed at the backline.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'A drive is a flat, fast shot hit horizontally over the net.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('03510814-6afa-42ae-b9f6-fd8437d26fa7', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Skills', 'Which hero can "copy" the Ultimate skill of an enemy?', 'text', null, 'Valentina', 'Valentina''s ultimate "I Am You" allows her to siphon and use the ultimate of a targeted enemy.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('03a53980-54fd-4632-ab9c-0f05d8d12f9a', 'sports', 'Boxing', 'Who did Muhammad Ali fight in the "Rumble in the Jungle"?', 'text', null, 'George Foreman', 'Held in Zaire in 1974.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('03cabef9-c87e-4b5e-bf29-257592d95021', 'history', 'Space Race', 'What was the name of the first satellite launched into orbit?', 'text', null, 'Sputnik 1', 'Launched by the Soviet Union in 1957.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('03d4a7d0-11af-40fc-81be-741ace054ae1', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Lore', 'Which hero was a "General" from a foreign land inspired by historical Korean figures?', 'text', null, 'Yi Sun-shin', 'He is based on the famous Korean naval commander and utilizes both a bow and a glaive.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('03d4b7e0-5c17-4373-ad98-ab3ac12c90ce', 'badminton', 'Scoring', 'Can a badminton match end with a score of 2-0?', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'If a player wins the first two games, the third game is not played.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0416180f-ea56-4835-9093-4d8e6673a268', 'badminton', 'Technique', 'The "Scissors Kick" is a footwork move performed during a net drop.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'The Scissors Kick is a mid-air leg swap used during jump smashes.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('046c1720-4b56-404d-af1c-2dbc59bc21e5', 'sports', 'Tennis', 'What is the nickname for the French Open?', 'text', null, 'Roland Garros', 'Named after a French aviator.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('04a85bc7-333c-4f1a-99dc-0ef788974064', 'mobile legends', 'Item Passive', 'The "Demon Hunter Sword" deals % HP damage.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'It deals damage based on current HP.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('05036c9b-8bbe-4958-8089-16f565496d8b', 'geography', 'Rivers', 'The Danube is the longest river in Europe.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'The Volga is the longest.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('05070d98-04c9-4516-8e7a-1990114f4a41', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Passive', 'Which hero can "come back as an egg" to move around after dying?', 'text', null, 'Diggie', 'Diggie''s passive allows him to scout and disrupt while waiting to respawn.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('05590bf9-7fbf-4449-a465-7baee42fddb7', 'sports', 'Basketball', 'How many NBA championships did Michael Jordan win?', 'multiple_choice', '["4","5","6","7"]', '6', 'All with the Chicago Bulls.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0589572c-c600-460d-97ec-294fc16ee674', 'mobile legends', 'True Damage', 'True damage ignores all physical and magic defense stats.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'True damage bypasses all forms of defense, dealing its full value directly to the enemy HP.', '2026-05-04 16:35:11.324679+00'), ('059045b1-ea5c-44fc-aff3-7e44bc4333ae', 'badminton', 'Service Rules', 'The server and receiver must have both feet stationary until the shuttle is hit.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Moving the feet or lifting a foot before the serve is struck is a service fault.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('05d1aef8-91f6-41f4-8d21-c6c19b128288', 'badminton', 'Faults', 'It is legal to shout "Out!" while the shuttle is in the air to distract the opponent.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'Making loud noises to distract an opponent is considered unsportsmanlike and is a fault.', '2026-05-04 16:35:11.324679+00'), ('05f12856-a746-4ea9-a106-1a81ba2c20d2', 'badminton', 'Scoring', 'If the score is 20-20, a player wins if they reach 22-20.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'In a deuce, a player must lead by 2 points to win.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('063a456c-2eec-4344-86b1-45ae7d915f36', 'badminton', 'Technique', 'The "Deceptive" drop shot is hit with a slow arm movement.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'A deceptive drop uses a fast arm swing to look like a smash, but slows down at the last second.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('06aab0d8-c05a-4472-bfc8-e32b86dc2905', 'history', 'Civil Rights', 'Who was the "Mother of the Civil Rights Movement"?', 'text', null, 'Rosa Parks', 'Her arrest sparked the 381-day Montgomery Bus Boycott.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0787687b-129a-42d2-982a-0f9f44e31a40', 'mobile legends', 'Item Passive', 'Which item provides the highest "Attack Speed" in the game?', 'multiple_choice', '["Windtalker","Golden Staff","Corrosion Scythe","Demon Hunter Sword"]', 'Golden Staff', 'Golden Staff provides a massive +65% attack speed at max stacks.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('079c8811-0913-415c-a996-ccf44ac492d2', 'mobile legends', 'Max Level', 'What is the maximum level a hero can reach in a standard match?', 'text', null, '15', 'Heroes cap out at level 15, which maximizes their skill points and base attributes.', '2026-05-04 16:35:11.324679+00'), ('07c5c0e5-7a8a-4c36-9415-5f58607080ba', 'sports', 'Baseball', 'How many bases are on a baseball field?', 'text', null, '4', 'First, second, third, and home plate.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('07e7c334-a44e-4d38-ac26-a86ad03fc742', 'badminton', 'History', 'Badminton is named after the estate of the Duke of Beaufort.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Badminton House in Gloucestershire is where the game was famously played and refined.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('0821f422-0f3d-450e-b79d-6d1724d68fcd', 'badminton', 'Tournament Points', 'Winning a BWF Super 1000 tournament grants how many ranking points?', 'text', null, '12000', 'Super 1000 tournaments are the highest tier in the regular BWF World Tour cycle.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('087aeffa-a421-4de7-9bc5-b030b6849f2b', 'science', 'Biology', 'The human heart has 4 chambers.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Left and right atria, and left and right ventricles.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('08f14f42-7da3-4a92-8e4e-c311e119f5fb', 'badminton', 'Scoring', 'If the score is 20-20, you win at 21 points.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'A 2-point lead is required (e.g., 22-20).', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('0938aefc-aaeb-437a-900e-6f217e7b6177', 'history', 'Ancient Greece', 'Who was the Greek god of the sea?', 'multiple_choice', '["Zeus","Hades","Poseidon","Apollo"]', 'Poseidon', 'Brother of Zeus and Hades.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('099b7301-3f77-4d57-bd37-cb72a9dd56e8', 'sports', 'Olympics', 'The 2020 Summer Olympics were delayed until 2021.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Due to the COVID-19 pandemic.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('09a5158b-5177-4a95-9dca-ed15b89db997', 'sports', 'Golf', 'What is the term for a score of two over par on a single hole?', 'text', null, 'Double Bogey', 'A common score in recreational golf.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('09f67d3a-36ab-4e51-8e83-a79152bd668b', 'science', 'Botany', 'What is the study of fungi called?', 'text', null, 'Mycology', 'Fungi are distinct from plants as they cannot photosynthesize.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0a0c78b8-3180-4e1d-95b1-4a8a77439589', 'badminton', 'History', 'Badminton debuted as a medal sport in the 1992 Olympics.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'The Barcelona 1992 Games were the official competitive debut for the sport.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('0a6bbd9b-fab9-4ba0-86f5-3b5ff2df5e4c', 'badminton', 'Racket Grip', 'An "Overgrip" is applied directly onto the wood handle.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'Overgrips are thin wraps applied over the original factory grip.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0ab70bcf-b1d8-4001-b466-5dc08010771c', 'badminton', 'Scoring', 'If the score reaches 29-29, the next person to score wins the game.', 'boolean', null, 'True', '30 points is the absolute cap in badminton scoring.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0b2d4fd1-b41f-48a6-8d9b-54d8843058d5', 'sports', 'Hockey', 'What is the name of the penalty where a player is sent off for 2 minutes?', 'text', null, 'Minor Penalty', 'The most common type of penalty.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0b4a139b-ec94-4f55-9960-4a39a106cdc9', 'badminton', 'Court Rules', 'The "T-Junction" is the intersection of the center line and which other line?', 'text', null, 'Short Service Line', 'The T-junction is the primary target for short serves in both singles and doubles.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0be73892-7adc-42d8-8e88-211942877f2b', 'badminton', 'Umpire Call', 'What does the umpire call when a server wins the game point?', 'text', null, 'Game Point', 'The umpire announces "Game Point" followed by the current score.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0c1a0994-6788-416a-a31e-893a298ceba5', 'mobile legends', 'Item Counter', 'Which item is best for countering "Physical Penetration" from assassins?', 'multiple_choice', '["Antique Cuirass","Blade Armor","Dominance Ice","Oracle"]', 'Antique Cuirass', 'It reduces the enemy''s Physical Attack, which effectively mitigates the impact of their penetration stats.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('0ca17ee1-d127-46a6-9b1d-e4fd5795bc95', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Lore', 'Gusion belongs to which noble family?', 'text', null, 'Paxley', 'Gusion is the fourth son of the Paxley family, a lineage of powerful mages.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0cd5b5d4-4ef4-4686-acf1-8e7ee5060f7c', 'science', 'Chemistry', 'What is the chemical symbol for Lead?', 'text', null, 'Pb', 'From the Latin "plumbum".', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0cefab18-7387-4be5-9e9b-a64fcb8c7a6e', 'badminton', 'Modern Origins', 'In which country were the modern rules of badminton first standardized?', 'multiple_choice', '["India","China","England","Malaysia"]', 'England', 'The modern game was standardized at Badminton House, the estate of the Duke of Beaufort in Gloucestershire.', '2026-05-04 16:35:11.324679+00'), ('0d562096-0f0c-437e-a2ce-0e1191b9c2ea', 'science', 'Space', 'Which planet is known as the Red Planet?', 'multiple_choice', '["Venus","Mars","Jupiter","Saturn"]', 'Mars', 'Mars appears red due to iron oxide on its surface.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0d92089c-7180-49fa-a5aa-8a44ea7f68ed', 'history', 'Viking Age', 'Vikings were known as skilled seafarers and raiders.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'They originated from Scandinavia.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0dec89aa-eed7-4af5-885d-53569529dc27', 'badminton', 'Fastest Smash', 'The fastest recorded smash in professional badminton exceeds 500 km/h.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Satwiksairaj Rankireddy set a world record with a smash speed of 565 km/h in 2023.', '2026-05-04 16:35:11.324679+00'), ('0df28886-a866-437d-8a2b-10bfb21359bb', 'badminton', 'Double Rule', 'In doubles, any player on the serving side can serve at the start of a game.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'The team decides which partner will start as the server for the first point.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0e85d303-5075-4985-a9cf-49182afae085', 'geography', 'Mountains', 'What is the name of the mountain range that separates Europe and Asia?', 'text', null, 'Ural Mountains', 'Located primarily in Russia.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0e8c0c7c-7bb8-4a12-a53e-aef22e2631c3', 'sports', 'Soccer', 'Which country won the 2022 FIFA World Cup?', 'multiple_choice', '["France","Brazil","Argentina","Germany"]', 'Argentina', 'Led by Lionel Messi to their third title.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0f1dcb7e-4c88-4936-91fc-f4a5af55ce16', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Lore', 'Who is the "King of Fire" and brother of Valir?', 'text', null, 'Vale', 'Vale and Valir are iconic elemental heroes with deep-rooted lore rivalries.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0f4b3bb6-12bb-4306-8faf-07687297a0e2', 'mobile legends', 'Item Passive', 'Which item grants 50% extra movement speed after hitting 5 consecutive attacks?', 'multiple_choice', '["Hunter Strike","Malefic Roar","War Axe","Blade of Despair"]', 'Hunter Strike', 'The "Hunt" passive triggers after 5 hits on heroes or creeps.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('0f6db678-f5ab-46dc-9d2d-821b4dca1444', 'badminton', 'Service Fault', 'Is it a fault if the server touches the boundary line with their foot during the serve?', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'The server must stand entirely within the boundaries of the service court.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('0f72104a-0f42-4aeb-a699-3330628ee16f', 'geography', 'Mountains', 'What is the longest mountain range?', 'text', null, 'Andes', 'Located in South America.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0faf93e8-3d66-42cb-bea7-0152435e1b89', 'mobile legends', 'Item Passive', 'Which item provides physical penetration that scales with the enemy''s physical defense?', 'multiple_choice', '["Hunter Strike","Malefic Roar","Heptaseas","War Axe"]', 'Malefic Roar', 'Malefic Roar provides 20% base penetration plus extra based on the target''s armor.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('0fcf3e6f-a493-486e-8841-0e56b3b9a216', 'science', 'Space', 'The sun is a star.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'A yellow dwarf star at the center of our solar system.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('0fd4938e-ea39-48f6-948a-f408a152ce26', 'badminton', 'Racket Parts', 'What is the "Ferrule" of a racket?', 'text', null, 'The part connecting the handle to the shaft', 'The ferrule (cone) provides stability at the junction where the player''s grip ends.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('10430d5f-9467-4e8f-b0a0-a0e277ee4afc', 'sports', 'Basketball', 'How many periods are in an NBA game?', 'multiple_choice', '["2","3","4","5"]', '4', 'Each quarter is 12 minutes long.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('105d42ee-d289-4cda-b49d-0b432f941dc2', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Roles', 'Which hero is a "Support" that can transform an enemy into a "Cat" (Molina)?', 'text', null, 'Nana', 'Nana''s second skill, Molina Smooch, transforms an enemy into a small creature, preventing them from using skills.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('10f08076-2534-4f