","Cursed Helmet"]', 'Athena''s Shield', 'Athena''s Shield provides a massive magic reduction shield when taking magic damage.', '2026-05-04 16:35:11.324679+00'), ('11dd82a5-0cd3-490d-a969-7dd06a79e463', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Lore', 'Which hero is the "Goddess of Flowers" and a companion of Belerick?', 'text', null, 'Floryn', 'Floryn was born from a seedling in the Oasis and is a healer associated with nature.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('1214c598-0169-41c8-aa48-52e970fd5292', 'badminton', 'History', 'Badminton was once a part of the "Commonwealth Games" before it was in the Olympics.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'It was first included in the Commonwealth Games in 1966.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('12d332f0-9c2b-4dd8-9503-7c02748311b2', 'badminton', 'Shuttlecock', 'What is the "skirt" of a professional shuttlecock made of?', 'multiple_choice', '["Plastic","Nylon","Natural Feathers","Silk"]', 'Natural Feathers', 'A professional shuttlecock consists of 16 overlapping feathers, usually from a goose.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('12efc1c5-0cf9-4b5b-9ec2-105112a71c93', 'badminton', 'Scoring', 'A game ends at 21 points regardless of the lead.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'If the score is 20-20, a 2-point lead is required, or the first to reach 30 wins.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('1303d1a9-b9b0-4387-a65d-f6268e1b0783', 'mobile legends', 'Item Passive', 'The "Immortality" item resurrects you.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'It provides a second life after a short delay.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('130847de-fbda-47b7-94f8-1bef30581cc0', 'history', 'Ancient Rome', 'Who was the Roman god of war?', 'multiple_choice', '["Mars","Jupiter","Neptune","Vulcan"]', 'Mars', 'Equivalent to the Greek god Ares.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('132aeabd-62df-4f39-be3a-e9f0c07bcd80', 'badminton', 'Court Surface', 'What is the standard material for professional badminton mats?', 'text', null, 'PVC', 'Professional courts use synthetic PVC mats for 