y way to mitigate the impact of physical percent-HP damage items.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('63d6ccf0-d927-4b31-8675-a3e40da7f7ba', 'badminton', 'Service Fault', 'Is it a fault if the server hits the shuttle above 1.15m height?', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Modern BWF rules mandate a fixed service height limit of 1.15 meters.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('640b151c-37de-4423-a7b2-14f74ca576d2', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Passive', 'Which hero gains "Shield" every time they use a skill that hits an enemy?', 'text', null, 'Esmeralda', 'Esmeralda generates shields for herself while also siphoning shields from her enemies.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('6470ae54-247b-416b-a591-5230f092c8d5', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Passive', 'Which hero has a passive that lets them "float" through walls after using a skill?', 'text', null, 'Pharsa', 'Pharsa can turn into a bird (Verri) to traverse any terrain for a few seconds.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('6485c2cd-7ea2-4e20-8c5b-e3427f1c5fb5', 'badminton', 'Service Direction', 'In doubles, the serve must always be hit diagonally.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'All legal serves in badminton must travel cross-court to the diagonal service area.', '2026-05-04 16:35:11.324679+00'), ('648bbd2e-dfa6-4be2-8576-d0fb861209be', 'badminton', 'Double Strategy', 'In an "Attacking" formation, the front player covers the net.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'The front player intercepts net returns while the back player smashes.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('64b57177-9986-4dbc-8b33-27a147ba6ea4', 'badminton', 'Shuttlecock Physics', 'A "Slow" shuttlecock is typically used in cities with high temperatures or high altitudes.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Since heat and altitude make shuttles fly faster, "slower" rated shuttles are used to balance the game.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('64e02ca5-809e-464c-ae4f-cdb32a2b5bd9', 'history', 'Ancient Egypt', 'The Great Pyramid is the only one of the Seven Wonders still largely