nd.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('f55efb66-2e36-4a12-aeed-9d31bf4ec145', 'badminton', 'Court Surface', 'What is the standard color of a professional BWF tournament mat?', 'text', null, 'Green', 'Green is the traditional and standard color for professional badminton courts.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('f58db6db-e4bd-46a8-800f-a3c7d4837e7b', 'geography', 'Landmarks', 'Where is Machu Picchu located?', 'multiple_choice', '["Chile","Peru","Bolivia","Ecuador"]', 'Peru', 'An Incan citadel in the Andes Mountains.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('f58e93dc-bb9a-4d4b-9561-ba69717a0849', 'geography', 'Islands', 'What is the largest country in the world by island count?', 'text', null, 'Sweden', 'Has over 260,000 islands.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('f5ba5550-da70-4762-a894-6c17d512eaa2', 'badminton', 'Umpire Call', 'What does the Umpire call when a player successfully wins a challenge using the Instant Review System?', 'text', null, 'Correction', 'If the review shows the shuttle was in/out contrary to the original call, the Umpire calls "Correction".', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('f5ecf48e-6706-4e76-abbf-b237a8048786', 'science', 'Biology', 'Humans have 46 chromosomes.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Arranged in 23 pairs.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('f64530b8-c18d-4fab-9949-bfd702eaabb8', 'mobile legends', 'Map Objectives', 'Destroying the "Base Turret" (Tier 3) spawns Super Minions.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'Super Minions are stronger and help push the lane toward the enemy base.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('f64b5ffb-ef5e-4f4a-8aa4-625e07fed716', 'badminton', 'Net Physics', 'The net is lower in the center than at the posts.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'The net is 1.55m at the posts and 1.524m (5 feet) in the center.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('f71c29b9-51da-4654-8f78-1983c5fa95b2', 'badminton', 'Faults', 'If the shuttle touches the net and falls into the opponent''s court during a serve, it is a "let".', 'boolean',