 of Lancelot?', 'text', null, 'None', 'Lancelot is an only child in the lore; Gusion has brothers (like Aamon), but no hero is Lancelot''s brother.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('fcf6680f-af50-490a-bd66-51367f82881d', 'geography', 'Cities', 'What is the capital of France?', 'text', null, 'Paris', 'Paris is known as the City of Light.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('fd09784f-0d03-4df2-a3f4-4561341f5a64', 'sports', 'Baseball', 'The "World Series" is the championship of MLB.', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'First played in 1903.', '2026-05-03 07:30:13.653206+00'), ('fd7015d2-d197-46cb-982d-ca5383835677', 'mobile legends', 'Hero Passive', 'Which hero has a passive that lets them "Resurrect" as a small cat-like creature?', 'text', null, 'Nana', 'Nana''s "Molina''s Blessing" triggers upon taking fatal damage, transforming her and making her untargetable.', '2026-05-04 16:41:37.027657+00'), ('fd79e192-e989-4572-886a-2e33b172d0e7', 'badminton', 'Racket Tension', 'Thicker strings (higher gauge) provide better "Control" than thinner strings.', 'boolean', null, 'False', 'Thinner strings provide better feel and control; thicker strings provide durability.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('fd8cbb7b-2150-490b-aa37-c0b4bf32d7ef', 'wild rift', 'Baron Nashor Buff', 'What is the primary benefit of the Hand of Baron buff?', 'multiple_choice', '["Increased movement speed in river","Empowering nearby minions","Instant health regeneration","True damage on all attacks"]', 'Empowering nearby minions', 'The Baron buff significantly strengthens nearby minions, making it easier for a team to siege the enemy base.', '2026-05-10 05:18:51.222538+00'), ('fdd87822-2a77-4b90-a42e-70adbaaabe83', 'mobile legends', 'Item Passive', 'The "Dominance Ice" reduces enemy "Attack Speed".', 'boolean', null, 'True', 'The Arctic Cold passive slows down nearby physical attackers.', '2026-05-04 16:49:09.338496+00'), ('fdfdc23e-d96c-401b-9e98-ce85f460f26b', 'science', 'Chemistry', 'What is the most abu